  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Go to World menu\n\n3. Select any world\n\n4. Click Preload World and go to any instance, or switch to other instance of any worlds that are cached\n\n5. The download screen, when not preloading world, appears and it says 0B/<World Size> with the Return to Home button for a few seconds, then world is loaded (same in the attachment)\n\nI also tried clearing caches, verified files integrity through steam, but the problem still persists",
